<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
  <head>
    <meta content='text/html; charset=UTF-8' http-equiv='Content-Type' />
  </head>
  <body>
    <h2>New RFQ Created</h2>
    
    <p>A new Request for Quotation has been created:</p>
    
    <div style="background-color: #f8f9fa; padding: 15px; border-radius: 5px; margin: 20px 0;">
      <h3>RFQ Details:</h3>
      <p><strong>RFQ Number:</strong> <%= @rfq.rfq_number %></p>
      <p><strong>Description:</strong> <%= @rfq.description %></p>
      <p><strong>Requesting Agency:</strong> <%= @agency.name %></p>
      <p><strong>Status:</strong> <%= @rfq.status.humanize %></p>
      <p><strong>Date Created:</strong> <%= @rfq.created_at.strftime("%B %d, %Y at %I:%M %p") %></p>
    </div>
    
    <% if @rfq.vehicle.present? %>
    <div style="margin: 20px 0;">
      <h3>Vehicle Information:</h3>
      <p><strong>Vehicle:</strong> <%= @rfq.vehicle.vehicle_number %> - <%= @rfq.vehicle.make %> <%= @rfq.vehicle.model %></p>
    </div>
    <% end %>
    
    <p>Please review this RFQ and take appropriate action:</p>
    
    <div style="margin: 30px 0; text-align: center;">
      <a href="http://localhost:3000/rfqs/<%= @rfq.id %>" style="background-color: #0d6efd; color: white; padding: 12px 24px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 5px; font-weight: bold;">Review RFQ</a>
    </div>
    
    <p>If you have any questions, please contact the requesting agency.</p>
    
    <hr style="margin: 30px 0; border: none; border-top: 1px solid #dee2e6;">
    
    <p style="color: #6c757d; font-size: 12px;">
      This is an automated notification from the ActivePlus Fleet Management System.<br>
      Please do not reply to this email.
    </p>
  </body>
</html>
